BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sept 1 | ‘No Exit’ Film Screening and Reporter Q&A
DTSTART:20260901T190000
DTEND:20260901T203000
DTSTAMP:20260830T152327Z
UID:00b64804b7499a420e93df59e23a49@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Vermont Public and the Paramount Theatre invite you to a free 
 screening of No Exit: Inside a Botched ICE Raid in Vermont\, followed by a
  conversation with Vermont Public’s Liam Elder-Connors and Zoe McDonald 
 . Go behind the scenes of the film’s reporting and production\, and lear
 n more about what unfolded that day in South Burlington. Please note: This
  film contains strong language and physical violence. Reserve your free ge
 neral admission tickets at https://paramountvt.org/event/no-exit/ . Schedu
 le Doors open - 6:30 p.m. Film begins - 7:00 p.m. Community Conversation -
  7:30 p.m. Event ends - 8:30 p.m. Accommodations Vermont Public is committ
 ed to providing access and accommodation for individuals with disabilities
  at our events. To request accommodations\, please email events@vermontpub
 lic.org or call us at 802-655-9451 at least seven days in advance of the e
 vent. Cancellation Policy Please let us know by emailing events@vermontpub
 lic.org if you are not able to join us so that we may release your tickets
  to someone else. Directions and Parking Paramount Theatre is located at 3
 0 Center St\, Rutland\, VT 05701 . Paid street parking is enforced from 8a
 m – 6pm on Mondays through Fridays. Near the Paramount are two reserved 
 accessible parking spaces. Located directly across the street are another 
 two accessible reserved spaces as well. Parking in the LAZ-managed parking
  garage is accessed on West Street (one block north of The Paramount) and 
 is $1/hr with a maximum fee of $3. Please remember to bring your parking r
 eceipt inside the theatre and/or credit card with you as you will need it 
 to regain entry into the garage. Other questions? Email us at events@vermo
 ntpublic.org .\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:The Paramount Theatre\, 30 Center St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/no-exit-fi
 lm-screening-and-reporter-q-a-31-07-2026-15-00-33
END:VEVENT
